[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799880618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105329#issuecomment-2799880618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105329","id":2799880618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m4smq","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T09:36:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T09:41:31Z","body":"It should still be possible to do this with just integer operations, not going through floats.\r\n\r\n2D example in C:\r\n\r\n```c\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n\r\nint main() {\r\n    for (int y = -9; y <= 9; y++) {\r\n        for (int x = -9; x <= 9; x++) {\r\n            /*\r\n            int grid_x = x / 3;\r\n            int grid_y = y / 3;\r\n            */\r\n            int grid_x = x >= 0 ? x / 3 : -((-x-1) / 3 + 1);\r\n            int grid_y = y >= 0 ? y / 3 : -((-y-1) / 3 + 1);\r\n            printf(\"(%2d,%2d) \", grid_x, grid_y);\r\n        }\r\n        printf(\"\\n\");\r\n    }\r\n    return 0;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(-3,-3) (-3,-3) (-3,-3) (-2,-3) (-2,-3) (-2,-3) (-